<title>USA: Frontier Insurance completes acquisition.</title>
<headline>Frontier Insurance completes acquisition.</headline>
<dateline>ROCK HILL, New York 1997-06-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Frontier Insurance Group Inc said it has completed its acquisition of Lyndon Property Insurance Co and its six subsidiaries from Mercury Finance Co for $92 million.</p>
<p>Lyndon provides insurance programs for credit-related insurance, residual value, extended service contracts, and collateral protection coverages. Lyndon's operations will remain headquartered in St. Louis under the direction of Chief Executive Roland Anderson.</p>
<p>Frontier is an insurance holding company.</p>
<p>((-- New York Newsdesk 212-859-1610))</p>
